WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.650
Is there a supermarket near here?

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:05.850
Marsha knows.

3
00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:08.110
Marsha's work number is 555-8986.

4
00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:15.170
Hello.

5
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.470
Hello. Is this Marsha?

6
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:18.990
It is Anna.

7
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.530
I am sorry. You have the wrong number.

8
00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.010
Oh. Is this 555-8986?

9
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.850
No. This is 555-8689.

10
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.710
Oh, excuse me!

11
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:34.610
Okay. 'Bye.

12
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.630
One more time.

13
00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:43.370
555-8986.

14
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:44.070
Please be Marsha.

15
00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:46.650
Hello. This is Marsha.

16
00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:47.650
Yes, Marsha.

17
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.170
I want to cook dinner.

18
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:51.290
Excuse me?

19
00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.090
Anna, is that you?

20
00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:54.750
Oh, yes. I am here!

21
00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.790
Good. You are there.

22
00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:59.770
I want to find a supermarket.

23
00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:01.230
Oh, okay.

24
00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:06.170
The supermarket is at 1500 Irving Street.

25
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.090
It is near the apartment.

26
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.850
Great! Goodbye!

27
00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.330
Goodbye, Anna.

28
00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:16.210
There is a big supermarket on our street.

29
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:20.030
And Marsha says I am a good cook!

30
00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:22.390
Until next time!

31
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:23.250
Bye!
